Package: mica-mqtt-broker
Version: 0.0.1-3
Source-Date-Epoch: 1792540800
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: passwd, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Mica OS local MQTT broker
 An MQTT 3.1.1 broker configured by micad from the mqtt settings. Carries a
 systemd unit and an OpenRC script and enables neither: micad starts it when
 MQTT is enabled, after writing its configuration.
